{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1616602501"}, "name":{"label":"Coast lax"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-04T14:03:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14263513920"}, "title":{"label":"Great, but…"}, "content":{"label":"I feel like this app is great. I’ve only been using this app for one day and I’ve already doubled my water intake. I love how the counter and the streak counter encourages people to continue. As a competitive person this is perfect for me. The only thing I would want to change would be for some of the things that you have to pay for to be free. For example, the other drink options are blocked off because I do not pay for it, but in some of the other reviews people don’t always drink water all the time. Some people get their water intake from other beverages which was why the company put the other options. Yes, I get that because of this similarity between a lot of people it would be smart to put a price on something people would like to have. The reason why I would want the prices on that specifically to be taken down is because me, along with many other people have a strict household, meaning that the ability to pay for this would be harder to access. Other than that I love this app and I don’t regret downloading it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
